{"kind": "evidence", "tid": "TE022", "fact_tid": "TF022", "type": "text_quote", "source_url": "https://nelhydrogen.com/articles/in-depth/expanding-production-capacity-in-wallingford/", "archived_url": null, "local": "_research/market-players-policy/raw/ebe4e7e2c9ec_clean.txt", "sha256": "d76c215ee5b77bced0ad39ce97a21204442196bac28321f37cbd6ff5c24110b2", "accessed_at": "2026-07-21T13:34:37.651332+00:00", "http_status": 200, "locator": null, "verbatim": "The production capacity is expected to reach approximately 1 GW in April 2024.", "source_role": "원출처", "proposed_grade": {"authority": "B", "independence": "B", "directness": "A", "recency": "B"}, "capture": null}
{"kind": "fact", "tid": "TF023", "claim": "Nel ASA는 미국에 계획 중인 기가팩토리가 PEM과 알칼라인을 합산해 최대 약 4GW의 생산능력 잠재력을 가질 것이라고 밝혔다", "context": {"metric": "planned_gigafactory_capacity", "entity": "Nel ASA", "entity_id": null, "geography": "US", "period": "TBD", "as_of": "2023", "basis": "planned", "scenario": null, "definition": "Nel ASA 계획 중인 미국 기가팩토리 잠재 생산능력(PEM+알칼라인 합산), 최종 부지는 3개 주 중 미정 상태에서 발표된 수치"}, "value": {"raw": "4", "unit": "GW", "decimal": "4"}, "evidence_tids": ["TE023"], "proposed_grade": {"authority": "B", "independence": "B", "directness": "A", "recency": "B"}, "note": "Nel ASA 공식 웹사이트 아티클 직접 확인"}
{"kind": "evidence", "tid": "TE023", "fact_tid": "TF023", "type": "text_quote", "source_url": "https://nelhydrogen.com/articles/in-depth/expanding-production-capacity-in-wallingford/", "archived_url": null, "local": "_research/market-players-policy/raw/ebe4e7e2c9ec_clean.txt", "sha256": "d76c215ee5b77bced0ad39ce97a21204442196bac28321f37cbd6ff5c24110b2", "accessed_at": "2026-07-21T13:34:37.651332+00:00", "http_status": 200, "locator": null, "verbatim": "The planned Gigafactory will have a potential of up to ~4 GW production capacity, distributed between both PEM and Alkaline.", "source_role": "원출처", "proposed_grade": {"authority": "B", "independence": "B", "directness": "A", "recency": "B"}, "capture": null}
{"kind": "fact", "tid": "TF024", "claim": "미국 IRA 45V 청정수소 생산세액공제는 2025년 기준(임금·견습요건 충족 시) 수명주기 온실가스 배출이 kg당 0.45kg CO2e 미만인 경우 최고 kg당 $3.185의 세액공제를 제공한다", "context": {"metric": "tax_credit", "entity": "US IRA Section 45V", "entity_id": null, "geography": "US", "period": "2025", "as_of": "2026-03", "basis": "statutory_inflation_adjusted", "scenario": null, "definition": "청정수소 생산세액공제(CHPC) 2025년 기준 최고 구간, 임금·견습요건(PWA) 충족 시, 수명주기 온실가스 배출 0.45kgCO2e/kgH2 미만 구간. 인플레이션 연동 조정치(법정 기본액 $3.00/kg에서 조정됨)"}, "value": {"raw": "3.185", "unit": "USD_per_kg", "decimal": "3.185"}, "evidence_tids": ["TE024"], "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "note": "의회조사국(CRS) In Focus IF12602(2026-03-30 발간) 직접 확인"}
{"kind": "evidence", "tid": "TE024", "fact_tid": "TF024", "type": "text_quote", "source_url": "https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IF12602", "archived_url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260703145452/https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IF12602", "local": "_research/market-players-policy/raw/2e2d445b1b6a_clean.txt", "sha256": "ece2997be8ede4df3d76c2f15eeb6efe5df908a7818952a23c7e08142794c174", "accessed_at": "2026-07-21T13:34:07.807964+00:00", "http_status": 200, "locator": null, "verbatim": "For taxpayers meeting prevailing wage and apprenticeship requirements as described under 26 U.S.C. §45V, the maximum credit in 2025 was $3.185 per kilogram of QCH; amounts are adjusted annually for inflation. Taxpayers producing QCH with lifecycle GHG emissions below 0.45 kilograms of CO2e (through the point of production) are eligible for the full $3.185 credit.", "source_role": "원출처", "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "capture": null}
{"kind": "fact", "tid": "TF025", "claim": "미국 IRA 45V는 2025년 기준(PWA 충족 시) 수명주기 배출 0.45~1.5kg CO2e/kg 구간에 kg당 $1.065의 세액공제를 제공한다", "context": {"metric": "tax_credit", "entity": "US IRA Section 45V", "entity_id": null, "geography": "US", "period": "2025", "as_of": "2026-03", "basis": "statutory_inflation_adjusted", "scenario": null, "definition": "CHPC 2025년 기준 2번째 구간(PWA 충족), 배출 0.45kg 이상 ~1.5kg 미만 CO2e/kgH2"}, "value": {"raw": "1.065", "unit": "USD_per_kg", "decimal": "1.065"}, "evidence_tids": ["TE025"], "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "note": "CRS IF12602 직접 확인"}
{"kind": "evidence", "tid": "TE025", "fact_tid": "TF025", "type": "text_quote", "source_url": "https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IF12602", "archived_url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260703145452/https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IF12602", "local": "_research/market-players-policy/raw/2e2d445b1b6a_clean.txt", "sha256": "ece2997be8ede4df3d76c2f15eeb6efe5df908a7818952a23c7e08142794c174", "accessed_at": "2026-07-21T13:34:07.807964+00:00", "http_status": 200, "locator": null, "verbatim": "$1.065 per kilogram of QCH if the CO2e emissions rate was from 0.45 kilograms to less than 1.5 kilograms;", "source_role": "원출처", "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "capture": null}
{"kind": "fact", "tid": "TF026", "claim": "미국 IRA 45V는 2025년 기준(PWA 충족 시) 수명주기 배출 1.5~2.5kg CO2e/kg 구간에 kg당 $0.795의 세액공제를 제공한다", "context": {"metric": "tax_credit", "entity": "US IRA Section 45V", "entity_id": null, "geography": "US", "period": "2025", "as_of": "2026-03", "basis": "statutory_inflation_adjusted", "scenario": null, "definition": "CHPC 2025년 기준 3번째 구간(PWA 충족), 배출 1.5kg 이상 ~2.5kg 미만 CO2e/kgH2"}, "value": {"raw": "0.795", "unit": "USD_per_kg", "decimal": "0.795"}, "evidence_tids": ["TE026"], "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "note": "CRS IF12602 직접 확인"}
{"kind": "evidence", "tid": "TE026", "fact_tid": "TF026", "type": "text_quote", "source_url": "https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IF12602", "archived_url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260703145452/https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IF12602", "local": "_research/market-players-policy/raw/2e2d445b1b6a_clean.txt", "sha256": "ece2997be8ede4df3d76c2f15eeb6efe5df908a7818952a23c7e08142794c174", "accessed_at": "2026-07-21T13:34:07.807964+00:00", "http_status": 200, "locator": null, "verbatim": "$0.795 per kilogram of QCH if the CO2e emissions rate was from 1.5 kilograms to less than 2.5 kilograms; and", "source_role": "원출처", "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "capture": null}
{"kind": "fact", "tid": "TF027", "claim": "미국 IRA 45V는 2025년 기준(PWA 충족 시) 수명주기 배출 2.5~4.0kg CO2e/kg 구간(최저 구간)에 kg당 $0.635의 세액공제를 제공한다", "context": {"metric": "tax_credit", "entity": "US IRA Section 45V", "entity_id": null, "geography": "US", "period": "2025", "as_of": "2026-03", "basis": "statutory_inflation_adjusted", "scenario": null, "definition": "CHPC 2025년 기준 4번째(최저) 구간(PWA 충족), 배출 2.5kg~4.0kg CO2e/kgH2. 4.0kg 초과 시 공제 없음"}, "value": {"raw": "0.635", "unit": "USD_per_kg", "decimal": "0.635"}, "evidence_tids": ["TE027"], "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "note": "CRS IF12602 직접 확인"}
{"kind": "evidence", "tid": "TE027", "fact_tid": "TF027", "type": "text_quote", "source_url": "https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IF12602", "archived_url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260703145452/https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IF12602", "local": "_research/market-players-policy/raw/2e2d445b1b6a_clean.txt", "sha256": "ece2997be8ede4df3d76c2f15eeb6efe5df908a7818952a23c7e08142794c174", "accessed_at": "2026-07-21T13:34:07.807964+00:00", "http_status": 200, "locator": null, "verbatim": "$0.635 per kilogram of QCH if the CO2e emissions rate was between 2.5 and 4.0 kilograms.", "source_role": "원출처", "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "capture": null}
{"kind": "fact", "tid": "TF028", "claim": "EU RED III(지침 (EU) 2023/2413) 제22a조는 회원국이 2030년까지 산업부문 최종에너지·비에너지 용도 수소 사용량 중 최소 42%를 RFNBO(비생물기원 재생연료, 재생수소 포함)로 충당하도록 규정한다", "context": {"metric": "rfnbo_target_industry", "entity": "EU RED III (Directive (EU) 2023/2413)", "entity_id": null, "geography": "EU", "period": "2030", "as_of": "2023-11", "basis": "statutory", "scenario": null, "definition": "RED III 제22a조, 산업부문(NACE B/C/F/J) RFNBO(재생수소 등) 최소 비중 목표, 2030년"}, "value": {"raw": "42", "unit": "percent", "decimal": "42"}, "evidence_tids": ["TE028"], "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "note": "EUR-Lex 공식 지침 원문(Directive (EU) 2023/2413) 직접 확인"}
{"kind": "evidence", "tid": "TE028", "fact_tid": "TF028", "type": "text_quote", "source_url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2023/2413/oj/eng", "archived_url": "https://r.jina.ai/https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2023/2413/oj/eng", "local": "_research/market-players-policy/raw/b4666e2170df_clean.txt", "sha256": "0f034959b19a8fbb25822c730fb4094a67c406c84e80d396b0f5a605c83dfe25", "accessed_at": "2026-07-21T13:34:13.909866+00:00", "http_status": 200, "locator": null, "verbatim": "Member States shall ensure that the contribution of renewable fuels of non-biological origin used for final energy and non-energy purposes shall be at least 42% of the hydrogen used for final energy and non-energy purposes in industry by 2030, and 60% by 2035.", "source_role": "원출처", "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "capture": null}
{"kind": "fact", "tid": "TF029", "claim": "EU RED III 제22a조는 산업부문 RFNBO(재생수소 등) 비중 목표를 2035년까지 60%로 상향한다", "context": {"metric": "rfnbo_target_industry", "entity": "EU RED III (Directive (EU) 2023/2413)", "entity_id": null, "geography": "EU", "period": "2035", "as_of": "2023-11", "basis": "statutory", "scenario": null, "definition": "RED III 제22a조, 산업부문 RFNBO 최소 비중 목표, 2035년(2030년 42% 목표의 후속)"}, "value": {"raw": "60", "unit": "percent", "decimal": "60"}, "evidence_tids": ["TE029"], "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "note": "EUR-Lex 공식 지침 원문 직접 확인 — TF028과 동일 조항·동일 문장"}
{"kind": "evidence", "tid": "TE029", "fact_tid": "TF029", "type": "text_quote", "source_url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2023/2413/oj/eng", "archived_url": "https://r.jina.ai/https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2023/2413/oj/eng", "local": "_research/market-players-policy/raw/b4666e2170df_clean.txt", "sha256": "0f034959b19a8fbb25822c730fb4094a67c406c84e80d396b0f5a605c83dfe25", "accessed_at": "2026-07-21T13:34:13.909866+00:00", "http_status": 200, "locator": null, "verbatim": "Member States shall ensure that the contribution of renewable fuels of non-biological origin used for final energy and non-energy purposes shall be at least 42% of the hydrogen used for final energy and non-energy purposes in industry by 2030, and 60% by 2035.", "source_role": "원출처", "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "capture": null}
{"kind": "fact", "tid": "TF030", "claim": "EU RED III 제25조는 2030년까지 교통부문 에너지 공급 중 첨단바이오연료·바이오가스와 RFNBO(재생수소 유래연료 포함)의 합산 비중을 최소 5.5%로 규정한다", "context": {"metric": "rfnbo_target_transport", "entity": "EU RED III (Directive (EU) 2023/2413)", "entity_id": null, "geography": "EU", "period": "2030", "as_of": "2023-11", "basis": "statutory", "scenario": null, "definition": "RED III 제25조, 교통부문 첨단바이오연료(Annex IX Part A)+바이오가스+RFNBO 합산 최소 비중, 2030년(2025년 중간목표 1%)"}, "value": {"raw": "5,5", "unit": "percent", "decimal": "5.5"}, "evidence_tids": ["TE030"], "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "note": "EUR-Lex 공식 지침 원문 직접 확인. 원문은 EU식 소수점 표기(5,5%) 사용"}
{"kind": "evidence", "tid": "TE030", "fact_tid": "TF030", "type": "text_quote", "source_url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2023/2413/oj/eng", "archived_url": "https://r.jina.ai/https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2023/2413/oj/eng", "local": "_research/market-players-policy/raw/b4666e2170df_clean.txt", "sha256": "0f034959b19a8fbb25822c730fb4094a67c406c84e80d396b0f5a605c83dfe25", "accessed_at": "2026-07-21T13:34:13.909866+00:00", "http_status": 200, "locator": null, "verbatim": "the combined share of advanced biofuels and biogas produced from the feedstock listed in Part A of Annex IX and of renewable fuels of non-biological origin in the energy supplied to the transport sector is at least 1% in 2025 and 5,5% in 2030, of which a share of at least 1 percentage point is from renewable fuels of non-biological origin in 2030.", "source_role": "원출처", "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "capture": null}
{"kind": "fact", "tid": "TF031", "claim": "EU RED III 제25조는 2030년 교통부문 5.5% 합산 목표 중 최소 1퍼센트포인트는 RFNBO(재생수소 유래연료) 단독으로 충당하도록 규정한다", "context": {"metric": "rfnbo_target_transport", "entity": "EU RED III (Directive (EU) 2023/2413)", "entity_id": null, "geography": "EU", "period": "2030", "as_of": "2023-11", "basis": "statutory", "scenario": null, "definition": "RED III 제25조, 교통부문 RFNBO 단독 최소 비중(5.5% 합산 목표 내 하위 요건), 2030년"}, "value": {"raw": "1", "unit": "percentage_point", "decimal": "1"}, "evidence_tids": ["TE031"], "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "note": "EUR-Lex 공식 지침 원문 직접 확인 — TF030과 동일 조항·동일 문장"}
{"kind": "evidence", "tid": "TE031", "fact_tid": "TF031", "type": "text_quote", "source_url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2023/2413/oj/eng", "archived_url": "https://r.jina.ai/https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2023/2413/oj/eng", "local": "_research/market-players-policy/raw/b4666e2170df_clean.txt", "sha256": "0f034959b19a8fbb25822c730fb4094a67c406c84e80d396b0f5a605c83dfe25", "accessed_at": "2026-07-21T13:34:13.909866+00:00", "http_status": 200, "locator": null, "verbatim": "the combined share of advanced biofuels and biogas produced from the feedstock listed in Part A of Annex IX and of renewable fuels of non-biological origin in the energy supplied to the transport sector is at least 1% in 2025 and 5,5% in 2030, of which a share of at least 1 percentage point is from renewable fuels of non-biological origin in 2030.", "source_role": "원출처", "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "capture": null}
{"kind": "fact", "tid": "TF032", "claim": "EU RED III 제22b조는 회원국이 재생에너지 목표 궤도상에 있고 화석연료 기반 수소 비중이 2030년 23% 이하(2035년 20% 이하)인 경우, 산업부문 42% RFNBO 목표를 2030년에 한해 20% 완화할 수 있도록 허용한다", "context": {"metric": "rfnbo_target_industry_flexibility", "entity": "EU RED III (Directive (EU) 2023/2413)", "entity_id": null, "geography": "EU", "period": "2030", "as_of": "2023-11", "basis": "statutory", "scenario": null, "definition": "RED III 제22b조, 산업부문 RFNBO 목표(제22a조 42%) 완화 조건 — 20% 완화 시 사실상 목표치는 약 33.6%로 낮아짐(완화율 자체를 값으로 기록)"}, "value": {"raw": "20", "unit": "percent", "decimal": "20"}, "evidence_tids": ["TE032"], "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "note": "EUR-Lex 공식 지침 원문(제22b조) 직접 확인"}
{"kind": "evidence", "tid": "TE032", "fact_tid": "TF032", "type": "text_quote", "source_url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2023/2413/oj/eng", "archived_url": "https://r.jina.ai/https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2023/2413/oj/eng", "local": "_research/market-players-policy/raw/b4666e2170df_clean.txt", "sha256": "0f034959b19a8fbb25822c730fb4094a67c406c84e80d396b0f5a605c83dfe25", "accessed_at": "2026-07-21T13:34:13.909866+00:00", "http_status": 200, "locator": null, "verbatim": "A Member State may reduce the contribution of renewable fuels of non-biological origin used for final energy and non-energy purposes referred to in Article 22a(1), fifth subparagraph, by 20% in 2030, provided that... the share of hydrogen, or its derivatives, produced from fossil fuels which is consumed in that Member State is not more than 23% in 2030 and not more than 20% in 2035.", "source_role": "원출처", "proposed_grade": {"authority": "A", "independence": "A", "directness": "A", "recency": "A"}, "capture": null}
